                    p "Build TW Framework's own documentation site using TW Framework. - Zero JavaScript by default = instant load - File-based..."
                }

                div { class "docs-card"
                    h3 "Migrating from React / Next.js"
                    p "Moving from React to TW Framework? This guide maps React concepts to TW equivalents. | React / Next.js | TW Framework | ..."
                }

                div { class "docs-card"
                    h3 "Tutorial: Building a Portfolio Site"
                    p "Create a stunning developer portfolio with TW Framework. tw create my-portfolio cd my-portfolio [home]/ pages/ index.tw ..."
                }

                div { class "docs-card"
                    h3 "Progressive Web App (PWA) Guide"
                    p "Turn your TW Framework site into an installable Progressive Web App. A Progressive Web App works offline, can be install..."
                }

                div { class "docs-card"
                    h3 "Testing Guide"
                    p "Ensure your TW Framework projects are reliable with comprehensive testing. /\ /  \     E2E Tests (Few) /----\ /      \  ..."
                }

                div { class "docs-card"
                    h3 "Theme Customization"
                    p "TW Framework includes a powerful theme system supporting light, dark, and system modes. Enable themes in `tw.config`: na..."
                }

            }

